  <item>
    <title>Kootenai County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/kootenai-county-id</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-kootenai-county-id</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>ORA 25-0007: prohibits data centers in the Commercial zone; allows in Light Industrial and Industrial only with conditional use permit; bans data centers over the aquifer. Replaced a 183-day emergency moratorium (Mar 2, 2025). Commissioners directed staff to draft an outright ban in unincorporated areas</description>
  </item>
